ment: 0,0:06:17.39,0:06:19.92,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Mayoi nado naiComment: 0,0:06:19.99,0:06:24.35,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Seou mono ga aruComment: 0,0:06:24.52,0:06:26.86,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Hi ga noboriComment: 0,0:06:27.01,0:06:31.93,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Kanashimi sae hitoshiku terasuComment: 0,0:06:31.96,0:06:34.36,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,ShinjiterundaComment: 0,0:06:34.43,0:06:40.79,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Itsuka hitotsu ni tsunagaru mirai woComment: 0,0:06:40.79,0:06:44.47,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Issho ni mitsuke ni ikouComment: 0,0:06:44.49,0:06:48.66,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Kimi no kawari wa inaiComment: 0,0:06:48.84,0:06:50.50,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,WasurenaideComment: 0,0:06:50.60,0:06:52.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,We fight togetherDialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:18.58,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Ace! Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:21.98,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,The three of us have to set out to sea someday!Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.98,0:00:24.50,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We'll get out of this country and live freely!Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.77,0:00:28.94,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,From today onward, we're...Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.51,0:00:31.31,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,brothers!Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:34.31,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.04,0:00:55.13,Main,,0,0,0,,How long are you gonna keep moping?Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.10,0:01:02.57,Main,,0,0,0,,All the treasure we hid in the Middle Forest is gone.Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.57,0:01:06.41,Main,,0,0,0,,But that pile of loot doesn't matter anymore.Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.41,0:01:11.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo and I were gonna use it. It was our Pirate Fund.Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.73,0:01:15.30,Main,,0,0,0,,But, in the end, Sabo didn't use it.Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.30,0:01:19.38,Main,,0,0,0,,And so, I'm not gonna bother with it either.Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.38,0:01:23.29,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no point in gathering treasure if we can't even look after it.Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.29,0:01:25.45,Main,,0,0,0,,A-Ace...Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.45,0:01:26.27,Main,,0,0,0,,I...Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.14,0:01:31.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to become stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.51,0:01:33.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Stronger and stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.76,0:01:35.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Stronger and stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.28,0:01:36.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Stronger and stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.13,0:01:37.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Stronger and stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.31,0:01:37.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Stronger and stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.91,0:01:38.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Stronger and stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.99,0:01:40.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.13,0:01:41.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Stronger and stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.01,0:01:42.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Stronger and stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.08,0:01:42.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Stronger and stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.71,0:01:43.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Stronger and stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.88,0:01:44.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Stronger and stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.48,0:01:45.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Stronger and stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.66,0:01:46.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Stronger and stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.28,0:01:47.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Stronger and stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.62,0:01:50.02,Main,,0,0,0,,And even stronger than that!Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.02,0:01:53.39,Main,,0,0,0,,And then, I'll be able to protect anything...Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.39,0:01:55.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't have to lose anyone ever again!Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.27,0:01:59.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Please...Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.74,0:02:04.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace... don't die!Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.08,0:02:06.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous!Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.11,0:02:08.89,Main,,0,0,0,,You should be more worried about yourself than me!Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.89,0:02:10.98,Main,,0,0,0,,You're way weaker than I am!Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.26,0:02:14.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen up, and remember this, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.87,0:02:16.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I will not die!Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.38,0:02:24.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo made that request too.Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.86,0:02:28.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I promise. I will not die!Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.21,0:02:32.98,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'd die and leave behind a weakling of a brother like you!Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.57,0:02:42.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not all that smart, so I don't know what killed Sabo...Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.36,0:02:46.46,Main,,0,0,0,,But whatever it was, it was definitely the opposite of freedom!Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.90,0:02:50.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo died without ever gaining his freedom...Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.61,0:02:54.13,Main,,0,0,0,,But the two of us, who shared a toast with Sabo, are still alive!Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.96,0:03:00.87,Main,,0,0,0,,So, listen up, Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.87,0:03:05.70,Main,,0,0,0,,We have to live our lives without regrets!Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.24,0:03:26.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Noblemen only become true nobles once they turn eighteen.Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.19,0:03:31.22,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I will leave this kingdom when I turn seventeen!Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.88,0:03:38.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Someday, we'll head out to sea,Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.13,0:03:41.38,Main,,0,0,0,,and then we'll be able to do whatever we want!Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.38,0:03:43.42,Main,,0,0,0,,No one will have more freedom than us!Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.14,0:03:51.05,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that will make lots of people into our enemies...Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.05,0:03:55.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Gramps will become our enemy, too. We'll be risking our lives.Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.91,0:03:58.39,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll cast off when we turn seventeen!Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.39,0:04:02.35,Main,,0,0,0,,We will become pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.00,0:07:00.58,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Again, we turn time back a little...Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.58,0:07:04.50,Narrator,,0,0,0,,To the night when the Celestial Dragon's ship docked in Goa Kingdom.Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.95,0:07:11.69,Title,,0,0,240,,Will of the WindsDialogue: 0,0:07:05.81,0:07:12.10,Narrator,,0,0,0,,In a small village in a certain region of East Blue...Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.65,0:07:26.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you see that guy with the huge face who was here this afternoon?Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.09,0:07:28.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I've never seen anything like it!Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.09,0:07:31.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Look! His ship is huge too!Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.39,0:07:33.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Five hundred and eighty...Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.83,0:07:35.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Five hundred and eighty one...Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.83,0:07:38.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Five hundred and eighty two...Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.60,0:07:40.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Five hundred and eighty three...Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.94,0:07:42.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Five hundred and eighty four...Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.75,0:07:49.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Vyou're late, Dragon!Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.00,0:07:52.05,Main,,0,0,0,,How long did vyou plan to keep vus waiting?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.92,0:07:54.55,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.79,0:07:57.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Vyou... What's that?Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:07:59.25,Main,,0,0,0,,This is awful!Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.25,0:08:01.40,Main,,0,0,0,,You! Quickly, bring a doctor! This is an emergency!Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:02.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Right away!Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:09.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Really... Where have vyou been?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.46,0:08:12.84,Main,,0,0,0,,I was watching the ceremony for the World Nobles.Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.66,0:08:18.21,Main,,0,0,0,,How could vyou go there on vyour own, without telling vme about it!Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.34,0:08:22.68,Main,,0,0,0,,If you'd been there, we'd have stood out too much.Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.47,0:08:25.82,Main,,0,0,0,,This...Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.05,0:08:32.22,Main,,0,0,0,,We must grow stronger as quickly as possible.Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.44,0:08:34.73,Main,,0,0,0,,How are our provisions?Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.39,0:08:37.90,Main,,0,0,0,,A dojo in the village offered us some food.Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.55,0:08:43.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Time to set sail!Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.26,0:08:46.14,Main,,0,0,0,,We're going back to Baltigo!Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.74,0:08:57.48,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Some months later, after the World Government's inspection of Goa Kingdom...Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:04.19,Main,,0,0,0,,They've brought more trash!Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.59,0:09:09.43,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The people have settled into their old routines...Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.37,0:09:14.40,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The trash mountain is back, just like it was before.Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.76,0:09:22.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Here I come, Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.68,0:09:24.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.34,0:09:27.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.24,0:09:43.66,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that? You call this a fight?Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.83,0:09:51.00,Main,,0,0,0,,No matter how much force you put into it, there's no point if you can't hit me.Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.00,0:09:54.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I told you, rubber really isn't suited for battle.Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.20,0:09:55.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Don't say that!Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.16,0:09:59.02,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Are you trying to say that I'm wrong?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.02,0:10:02.82,Main,,0,0,0,,You're just an anchor who's immune to bulletfire!Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.82,0:10:06.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't make fun of the Rubber Fruit! Someday, I'll make you cry!Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.80,0:10:09.52,Main,,0,0,0,,After all, I've thought up a technique more powerful than a pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.32,0:10:12.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, great work!Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.77,0:10:16.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Your arm stretched a lot further than it did yesterday!Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.76,0:10:19.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo! You're far too soft on Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.84,0:10:23.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I really have become strong! Stronger than I was yesterday!Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.13,0:10:25.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sabo!Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.17,0:10:45.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo was such a kind older brother...Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.08,0:10:47.99,Main,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?! Would you rather I died instead?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.02,0:10:57.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow...Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.83,0:11:09.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I've founded my own country.Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.39,0:11:12.52,Main,,0,0,0,,A country?Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.00,0:11:15.72,Main,,0,0,0,,What's this?Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.68,0:11:18.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Me too.Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.86,0:11:19.72,Country Sign,,0,0,0,,Ace's CountryDialogue: 0,0:11:19.72,0:11:20.56,Country Sign,,0,0,0,,Luffy's CountryDialogue: 0,0:11:25.15,0:11:27.76,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it now?Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.76,0:11:32.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna learn to survive on my own. You guys can be Dadan's country.Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.97,0:11:34.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna borrow your bath every now and then.Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.70,0:12:02.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace! Help me out! It's a bear!Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.90,0:12:06.40,Main,,0,0,0,,You're gonna survive on your own, right?Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.01,0:12:10.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit...Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.36,0:12:21.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.73,0:12:36.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Dadan's country, is anyone here?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.12,0:12:39.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy is injured! Please, treat his wounds!Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.01,0:12:43.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Magra! Please, help Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.92,0:12:46.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, now... Come in, quickly!Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.34,0:13:02.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, now... This is no joke.Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.72,0:13:07.13,Main,,0,0,0,,If his wounds had been any worse, he could have died!Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.32,0:13:12.40,Main,,0,0,0,,The three of you always fought these wild beasts together as a team, right?Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.76,0:13:16.12,Main,,0,0,0,,It's my fault...Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.40,0:13:23.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought that I learned that fighting on your own doesn't prove that you're strong...Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.60,0:13:27.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm worthless!Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.09,0:13:29.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Completely worthless!Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.77,0:13:34.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace...Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.19,0:13:36.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.82,0:13:38.66,Main,,0,0,0,,So sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.61,0:13:50.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.98,0:13:54.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Makino-chan came all the way out here to bring us some drinks!Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.43,0:13:58.38,Main,,0,0,0,,How to greet people properly?Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.77,0:14:00.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.10,0:14:02.12,Main,,0,0,0,,What brought about this change of attitude?Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.12,0:14:04.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Luffy's brother, after all.Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.66,0:14:11.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Someday, I'd like to meet Captain Red Hair, and thank him for everything he did for my little brother.Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.58,0:14:22.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Why're you looking at me like that?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.72,0:14:28.14,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. But alright, I'll tell you.Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.14,0:14:30.55,Main,,0,0,0,,So, first of all...Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.55,0:14:32.75,Main,,0,0,0,,They ate and ran!Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.75,0:14:34.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.98,0:14:41.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, we're being rude here!Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.10,0:14:41.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Right...Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.06,0:14:48.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the food!Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.47,0:14:51.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you damn kids! Just pay the bill!Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.44,0:14:56.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna win today!Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.09,0:15:33.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright!Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.72,0:15:35.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Today, we'll be having bear-stew for dinner!Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.26,0:16:39.93,Captions,,0,0,25,,Seven years laterDialogue: 0,0:16:41.26,0:16:45.70,Captions,,0,0,20,,Ace, seventeen years oldDialogue: 0,0:16:47.00,0:16:51.84,Captions,,0,0,20,,Luffy, fourteen years oldDialogue: 0,0:17:04.19,0:17:06.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Take care, Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.20,0:17:10.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Sure! See you later, Luffy! I'll be going on ahead!Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.14,0:17:15.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Right! And when I set out to sea myself in three years, I'll be much stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.99,0:17:25.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Do your best, Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.13,0:17:26.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself!Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.88,0:17:28.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Try not to catch a cold!Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.79,0:17:32.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Just you wait! I'll make a name for myself real soon!Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.09,0:17:38.39,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Ace, the son of the pirate king who had grown up in secret...Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.39,0:17:43.01,Narrator,,0,0,0,,quietly set sail from the coast at the foot of Mt. Colubo.Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.30,0:18:01.21,Main,,0,0,0,,There he goes.Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.91,0:18:05.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Really, how is Garp going to take this?Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.78,0:18:26.46,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You raise him, Dadan.Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.46,0:18:28.84,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding me! Whose kid is that?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.92,0:18:32.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Boss...Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.20,0:18:34.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace has left.Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.71,0:18:41.46,Main,,0,0,0,,That so? I'm the one who'll get scolded by Garp for this...Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.46,0:18:43.91,Main,,0,0,0,,That little brat was just hopeless.Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.91,0:18:48.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, I have a message to you from Ace.Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.01,0:18:53.10,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Even now, after he's left, he's still complaining to me?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.10,0:18:55.75,Main,,0,0,0,,He said, "Sorry for all the trouble, and thanks."Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.22,0:19:04.79,Main,,0,0,0,,That idiot, he can't be serious!Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.75,0:19:08.54,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Boss, are you crying?Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.54,0:19:10.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not crying, you idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.27,0:19:25.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Only three more years for me!Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.30,0:19:27.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.14,0:19:29.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.79,0:19:36.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn... My aim was off.Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.90,0:19:42.06,Main,,0,0,0,,That was close, Luffy. Why don't you just aim a little lower?Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.70,0:19:48.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.80,0:19:49.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.65,0:20:05.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll become stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.75,0:20:09.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Much stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.27,0:20:11.52,Captions,,0,0,170,,Several months later...Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.88,0:20:18.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.40,0:20:20.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at the newspapers!Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.33,0:20:21.75,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.75,0:20:23.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at this!Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.74,0:20:26.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Amazing! Ace made a name for himself!Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.70,0:20:29.09,Main,,0,0,0,,The picture shows him with his pirate ship and crew!Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.09,0:20:33.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Amazing! Ace is amazing!Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.45,0:20:36.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna lose to him!Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.74,0:20:44.72,Captions,,0,0,350,,Three years later...Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.74,0:20:44.72,Captions,,0,0,50,,Luffy, seventeen years oldDialogue: 0,0:20:44.72,0:20:46.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on!Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.59,0:20:49.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going now. Aren't you gonna see me off?Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.54,0:20:51.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.10,0:20:52.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up...Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.12,0:21:00.24,Main,,0,0,0,,The mayor and Makino know us, but we'd scare the other villagers if we came down from the mountain.Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.24,0:21:01.44,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.96,0:21:03.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Just get going already!Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.42,0:21:07.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh... Well then, guys!Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.52,0:21:09.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything!Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.78,0:21:12.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't embarrass us... No need for thanks.Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.90,0:21:15.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, now... Take care.Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.46,0:21:17.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Sure, I will!Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.22,0:21:20.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, right!Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.25,0:21:24.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Dadan! I hate mountain bandits...Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.27,0:21:25.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you little brat!Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.05,0:21:29.80,Main,,0,0,0,,...but I like you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.14,0:21:36.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't say dumb stuff like that, and just get lost, damn you!Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.91,0:21:41.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Sheesh, you guys are just...Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.13,0:21:43.84,Main,,0,0,0,,What, are you crying?Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.84,0:21:46.45,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not!Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.95,0:21:52.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Windmill Village, at the outskirts of the Goa Kingdom on Dawn Island...Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.89,0:21:57.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, if you're going out to sea, then you should take my old fishing boat, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.20,0:21:59.43,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll sink right away if you take that thing!Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.43,0:22:01.80,Main,,0,0,0,,A rowing boat? Come on, now!Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.28,0:22:05.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm fine with this. My journey begins right now!Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.81,0:22:12.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo!Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.71,0:22:18.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at me! I'm setting out to sea too!Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.11,0:22:23.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo was first. Ace was second.Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.28,0:22:27.23,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm the third to go, but I won't lose!Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.23,0:22:31.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Ace! I'll catch up to you soon!Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.46,0:22:34.48,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Luffy? Shouting and muttering to yourself like that...Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.48,0:22:36.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it some sort of good luck charm?Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.64,0:22:38.80,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not it. It's a challenge!Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.14,0:22:41.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Who's Ace?Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.02,0:22:41.77,Main,,0,0,0,,No idea.Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.77,0:22:44.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm going now.Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.31,0:22:56.35,Main,,0,0,0,,There he goes, mayor...Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.35,0:22:58.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna miss him.Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.26,0:23:01.14,Main,,0,0,0,,He's a disgrace to the village! Becoming a pirate...Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.13,0:23:09.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah... It's a great day to set sail!Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.64,0:23:22.65,Main,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.14,0:23:29.55,Main,,0,0,0,,So there you are, lord of the coastal waters.Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.96,0:23:37.31,Main,,0,0,0,,You picked the wrong opponent.Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.73,0:23:40.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Check out my attack, I've been practicing for the past ten years!Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.94,0:23:44.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.11,0:23:52.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.89,0:24:10.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Learned your lesson yet, damn fish?Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.59,0:24:22.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Incredible... He beat the lord of the coastal waters with one punch!Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.94,0:24:26.48,Main,,0,0,0,,He's grown strong.Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.19,0:24:30.28,Main,,0,0,0,,First, I've gotta gather a crew.Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.28,0:24:32.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd like to have about ten people...Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.53,0:24:36.16,Main,,0,0,0,,And then I'll need a pirate flag!Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.96,0:24:41.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright... Here I come!Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.96,0:24:43.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be...Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.66,0:24:48.16,Main,,0,0,0,,the Pirate King!Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.22,0:24:59.88,Narrator,,0,0,0,,And now we return to the present day...Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.79,0:25:04.84,Narrator,,0,0,0,,His brother Ace is dead, and Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.62,0:25:07.26,Narrator,,0,0,0,,is crying.Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.81,0:25:22.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-kun...Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.67,0:25:25.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Pirate King? Yeah, right!Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.90,0:25:27.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm...Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.44,0:25:31.21,Main,,0,0,0,,so weak!Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.29,0:25:35.88,Captions,,0,0,30,,East Blue - Goa Kingdom - Windmill VillageDialogue: 0,0:25:31.21,0:25:32.48,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Garp-san!Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.48,0:25:34.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Garp-san has returned in a battleship!Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.82,0:25:35.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Is he on official business?Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.22,0:25:39.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Garp-san! I read the article about the war!Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.04,0:25:41.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard it was an overwhelming victory for the Navy?Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.03,0:25:43.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I'm glad to see you're all safe.Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.28,0:25:44.82,Main,,0,0,0,,How is Luffy doing?Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.82,0:25:48.30,Main,,0,0,0,,What will happen to the world now that Whitebeard is dead?Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.30,0:25:49.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Garp-san!Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.40,0:25:54.50,Main,,0,0,0,,These past few days, we've seen a lot of pirate ships on the open sea.Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.50,0:25:58.77,Main,,0,0,0,,They could attack us anytime, it's keeping us awake at night!Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.77,0:26:03.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I just sank three of them on the way here.Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.97,0:26:06.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Really? What a relief!Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.29,0:26:10.75,Main,,0,0,0,,They were just a bunch of amateur pirates who hadn't even learned how to spell "Battle".Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.75,0:26:13.45,Main,,0,0,0,,But still, Whitebeard was a deterrent.Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.45,0:26:18.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Now that the world has lost him, the seas are going to be uneasy for a while.Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.39,0:26:23.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down just because you live in a remote part of East Blue.Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.02,0:26:23.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Men.Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.66,0:26:24.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, Sir!Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.76,0:26:29.01,Main,,0,0,0,,"Security - Navy HQ Vice-Admiral Garp", huh?Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.01,0:26:30.83,Main,,0,0,0,,That's so reassuring!Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.83,0:26:33.74,Main,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to be afraid of now!Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.74,0:26:36.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Garp-san, we have another problem...Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.74,0:26:41.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Bandits came down out of the mountains, and took over Makino's bar!Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.95,0:26:43.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Bandits?Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.15,0:26:45.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop! Don't!Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.90,0:26:51.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Garp!Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.20,0:26:52.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's her!Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.69,0:26:58.06,Main,,0,0,0,,You've got some nerve showing your face here again!Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.29,0:27:01.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Garp-san!Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.14,0:27:02.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Boss!Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.39,0:27:03.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Vice-Admiral Garp!Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.55,0:27:13.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't interfere! I know this woman.Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.17,0:27:17.99,Main,,0,0,0,,You...Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.62,0:27:21.30,Main,,0,0,0,,You were right there on the battlefield...Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.23,0:27:24.14,Main,,0,0,0,,They were right there in front of you...Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.14,0:27:26.32,Main,,0,0,0,,So, what the hell were you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.32,0:27:28.30,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell were you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.30,0:27:30.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?! Why?! Why?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.84,0:27:33.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?! Why, dammit?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.01,0:27:44.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Why did you just let Ace die like that?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.15,0:27:48.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Is duty more important than your family?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.48,0:27:51.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh, Garp?! What kind of hero of the Navy are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.94,0:27:53.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Just die, you damn old man!Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.83,0:27:56.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, now, boss! Please stop!Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.20,0:27:57.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Boss...Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.09,0:28:00.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Garp, say something! Why didn't you help him?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.52,0:28:02.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you prevent it?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.59,0:28:05.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Stand up. Get on your feet!Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.03,0:28:08.53,Main,,0,0,0,,You inhuman filth!Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.27,0:28:11.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Dadan-san!Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.38,0:28:18.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Makino...Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.86,0:28:41.40,Main,,0,0,0,,They were within an arm's reach, yet he was unable to help them...Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.40,0:28:43.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Garp-san is suffering the most because of this!Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.16,0:28:55.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-You're wrong...Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.02,0:28:59.35,Main,,0,0,0,,You're wrong...Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.82,0:29:02.79,Main,,0,0,0,,You're wrong!Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.56,0:29:07.52,Main,,0,0,0,,The one who's in the most pain... is Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.24,0:29:21.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, try to imagine that he's right here in front of you.Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.88,0:29:25.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Ace! Who the hell are you?Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.19,0:29:29.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Bzzzz. That's no good. "Who the hell" is too rude.Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.77,0:29:32.04,Main,,0,0,0,,It's "Who're you?!", right?Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.01,0:29:34.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Who might you be?Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.59,0:29:35.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Bzzzz.Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.99,0:29:37.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is this?Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.72,0:29:39.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Bzzzz.Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.85,0:29:41.99,Main,,0,0,0,,It's "Who is that?", right?Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.99,0:29:43.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Bzzzz!Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.37,0:29:47.33,Main,,0,0,0,,All wrong. Are you even trying?Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.55,0:29:50.44,Main,,0,0,0,,This is all because you keep talking nonsense!Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.44,0:29:51.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Quit distracting me!Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.72,0:29:58.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ace! Yesterday, I found the nest of a giant snake, filled with huge eggs!Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.43,0:30:00.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go get them now!Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.08,0:30:02.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huge eggs?Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.34,0:30:04.49,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I can't!Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.49,0:30:07.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm studying how to greet people!Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.28,0:30:11.18,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'll be in trouble if that huge snake catches me by myself!Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.18,0:30:14.54,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,But I'll be fine if you're with me. So come on!Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.54,0:30:15.76,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.34,0:30:22.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how highly he thought of his brother?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.00,0:30:32.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Makino!Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.80,0:30:37.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Garp...Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.64,0:30:42.62,Main,,0,0,0,,How's Luffy? The newspapers say they don't know where he is...Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.62,0:30:43.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Mayor...Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.10,0:30:52.21,Main,,0,0,0,,He escaped in a submarine.Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.70,0:30:56.66,Main,,0,0,0,,The Navy pursued him with everything they had...Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.66,0:30:59.49,Main,,0,0,0,,and they searched the area thoroughly.Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.49,0:31:02.11,Main,,0,0,0,,But they couldn't find the ship.Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.14,0:31:06.18,Main,,0,0,0,,For now, at least he's alive!Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.46,0:31:08.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.51,0:31:14.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Still, how does Vice-Admiral Garp from Navy HQ and this bandit know each other?Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.90,0:31:15.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Who knows?Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.33,0:31:23.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy is such a fool!Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.91,0:31:28.27,Main,,0,0,0,,But whatever kind of pirate he becomes, it doesn't matter. I'm on his side.Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.70,0:31:33.50,Main,,0,0,0,,When I think about how he must be feeling...Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.50,0:31:35.67,Main,,0,0,0,,It's like my heart is getting torn in half.Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.01,0:31:47.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.28,0:31:53.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't give in to the pain!Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.60,0:32:00.35,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Now, we turn far away...Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.35,0:32:04.70,Narrator,,0,0,0,,to the second half of the Grand Line, The New World.Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.52,0:32:31.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Red Hair...Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.12,0:32:35.77,Main,,0,0,0,,How can I thank you for this?Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.07,0:32:39.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.82,0:32:43.67,Main,,0,0,0,,He might have been my enemy, but Whitebeard was a pirate worthy of respect.Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.75,0:32:47.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Even Sengoku thought so.Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.21,0:32:52.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, it's time for us to go.Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.48,0:32:54.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Sure... Thanks.Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.30,0:32:59.32,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Luffy... This must be difficult for you.Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.21,0:33:04.07,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I was surprised when I heard about Ace's last actions.Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.79,0:33:07.80,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Take back what you just said!Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.80,0:33:11.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Don't make fun of the man who saved my life!Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.10,0:33:15.01,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,The name of this era is "Whitebeard"!Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.69,0:33:24.85,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He behaved just like Captain Roger.Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.22,0:33:32.56,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,There were times when I wanted the captain to run away...Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.31,0:33:35.38,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I even wanted him to cry.Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.47,0:33:42.77,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.11,0:33:49.00,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Knowing both victory and defeat, running away and shedding tears...Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.39,0:33:52.17,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That is how men grow up.Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.10,0:34:05.59,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It's okay for you to cry.Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.76,0:34:09.62,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Overcome this!Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.38,0:34:20.42,Captions,,0,0,30,,"Calm Belt" - Island of WomenDialogue: 0,0:34:25.38,0:34:30.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it all! I'm so weak! I can't protect anything!Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.11,0:34:32.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-kun.Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.42,0:34:37.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Go away! Just leave me alone!Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.19,0:34:42.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I cannot do that! I cannot let you hurt yourself any more than you already have!Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.42,0:34:47.10,Main,,0,0,0,,It's my own body! I can do whatever I want with it!Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.54,0:34:53.87,Main,,0,0,0,,If so, then Ace-san's body was his own too. He was free to die, regardless of what we wanted!Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.87,0:34:56.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Be quiet!Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.14,0:34:58.68,Main,,0,0,0,,The next time you say something, I'll beat the crap out of you!Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.68,0:35:01.91,Main,,0,0,0,,If that will make you feel better then go ahead and try!Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.36,0:35:07.85,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm quite weakened myself, but I will not lose to you. Not as you are now!Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.10,0:35:09.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.98,0:35:11.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.17,0:35:38.02,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Jinbe...Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.99,0:35:41.97,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,While I was out chasing Teach...Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.36,0:35:48.61,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I met my little brother for the first time in three years, in the Alabasta Kingdom.Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.33,0:35:53.33,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,As soon as I saw him, I felt relieved.Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.22,0:35:57.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Why do you think that is?Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.73,0:36:05.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow! That hurts!Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.18,0:36:10.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I said that hurts, you little brat!Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.85,0:36:19.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you not see anything?!Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.52,0:36:26.63,Main,,0,0,0,,The confidence that you'll overcome all obstacles... Your strength, that you've never doubted before...Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.63,0:36:32.11,Main,,0,0,0,,A horde of enemies ruthlessly shattered your beliefs, and rendered you unable to do a thing...Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.11,0:36:35.10,Main,,0,0,0,,And then there's your brother, who was your guiding light...Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.10,0:36:37.61,Main,,0,0,0,,You have lost so many things.Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.61,0:36:43.36,Main,,0,0,0,,The great obstacle known as the world is blocking your vision!Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.00,0:36:47.84,Main,,0,0,0,,As you are now, you cannot see anything!Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.84,0:36:50.79,Main,,0,0,0,,You're being consumed by dark clouds of regret and self-blame!Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.48,0:36:54.34,Main,,0,0,0,,It might be hard for you, but Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.34,0:36:56.26,Main,,0,0,0,,You have to defeat those feelings!Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.74,0:36:59.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't just count everything you've lost!Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.12,0:37:06.15,Main,,0,0,0,,What's gone, is gone! But ask yourself this, what remains?!Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.12,0:37:57.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, don't play around up here!Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.56,0:37:59.19,Main,,0,0,0,,You're disrupting my training!Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.16,0:38:07.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, hurry and get everyone into position!Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.66,0:38:09.50,Main,,0,0,0,,A storm is coming!Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.09,0:38:16.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, watch me! I'm about to catch a huge fish!Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.35,0:38:23.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I'm almost done. Just wait patiently!Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.28,0:38:28.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, no matter how badly you get hurt, it'll be fine.Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.28,0:38:30.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Because I'm gonna fix you up!Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.10,0:38:36.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.02,0:38:40.76,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're interested in archeology, do you want me to teach you?Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.59,0:38:48.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy! The Cola Engine is running perfectly today.Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.58,0:38:52.54,Main,,0,0,0,,You can leave the Sunny to me!Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.30,0:38:57.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san, good morning! It is morning!Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.77,0:39:00.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Well then, I shall play a morning tune!Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.02,0:39:09.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.66,0:39:11.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.36,0:39:19.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.87,0:39:21.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san!Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.05,0:39:23.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.81,0:39:37.79,Main,,0,0,0,,My crew...Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.98,0:39:40.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I still have my crew!Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.38,0:39:42.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Zoro! Nami! Usopp!Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.67,0:39:45.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Chopper! Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.26,0:39:47.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Franky! Brook!Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.70,0:39:49.73,Main,,0,0,0,,My friends are still here!Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.28,0:39:53.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I see.Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.90,0:39:58.14,Main,,0,0,0,,We agreed on a meeting place...Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.78,0:40:01.78,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Everyone, let's meet up by the Sunny in three days!Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.78,0:40:03.38,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Right!Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.62,0:40:08.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I have to go... I'm pretty late, though...Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.98,0:40:12.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're all waiting for me!Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.51,0:40:17.13,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What I saw there...Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.13,0:40:18.46,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Jinbe...Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.60,0:40:23.86,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Since I have a clumsy little brother,Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.85,0:40:26.94,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about you as a big brother.Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.47,0:40:30.91,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's caused you guys a lot of trouble, too.Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.15,0:40:33.31,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Take care of him for me.Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.38,0:40:40.58,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I saw that he's no longer the same old Luffy who'd always chase after me.Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.85,0:40:42.86,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,He's...Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.34,0:40:48.35,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,got a reliable crew of his own.Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.86,0:40:53.06,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, he'll be alright.Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.61,0:40:56.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I was relieved.Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.20,0:41:02.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to see them soon...Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.89,0:41:06.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to see them again!Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.59,0:04:31.46,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing SewilDialogue: 0,0:04:31.46,0:04:34.19,Credits,,0,0,0